          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ठहरना (ṭhaharnā) goes back to stabhira, \"fixed, firm\", a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 13680), which lists Hindi ṭhaharnā, \"to stop\". To ṭhaharnā is to stand still in one place for a while."
